# Browser-gate output. Every check in the needs-browser tier writes a screenshot
# here, and there are eight of them across eight surfaces and two viewports —
# a few megabytes of PNGs that say nothing a reader of the log does not already
# say. The log lines are the artefact; the pixels are the evidence that the log
# lines were produced at all, and they are regenerated by the gate that wrote them.
